OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with death by
OL,4,Adangerous driving after four-year-old
OL,5,Akilled in crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been charged with death by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving after a "beautiful"
OL,9,Ffour-year-old was killed in a crash.
OL,11,FMoses Munthali, 28, appeared at
OL,12,FLivingston Sheriff Court where he made
OL,13,Fno plea and was remanded in custody. He
OL,14,Fwill appear again within eight days.
OL,16,FTiger Munthali died following the crash
OL,17,Fon 6 November, involving a black Range
OL,18,FRover, which happened on Drumcross Road
OL,19,Fin Bathgate, between Limefield Road and
OL,20,FDrumcross Farm.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
